Chapter: UefiGopConsoleTest
  cites Works chapter UefiConsole
  cites Works chapter GopAhci
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The console calls the Dev Console makes must reach the GOP grid once the
 block is on. "AB" at row 1 column 2 in white on blue must light only the two
 cells it names, and fill-row 3 in red must cover exactly one 640 by 16 band.
 The residue row is the control: any word but the magic leaves the grid off.

Section: Counting

  gw : Integer = 640

  gh : Integer = 400

  count : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  count (fb) (x0) (y0) (x1) (y1) (rgb) (y) (acc) =
    if y >= y1 then acc
    else count fb x0 y0 x1 y1 rgb (y + 1) (acc + count-row fb x0 x1 rgb y x0 0)

  count-row : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  count-row (fb) (x0) (x1) (rgb) (y) (x) (acc) =
    if x >= x1 then acc
    else count-row fb x0 x1 rgb y (x + 1) (if bit-and (peek-32 fb ((y * gw + x) * 4)) 16777215 == rgb then acc + 1 else acc)

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
    let fb = alloc-zeroed (gw * gh * 4) 64
    in let r0 = poke-32 ugc-block 0 12345
    in let off = ugc-on 0
    in let e = ugc-enable fb gw gh gw
    in act
      print-line-uni ("residue word leaves the grid off: " & (if off then "NO" else "yes") & ", magic turns it on: " & (if ugc-on 0 then "yes" else "NO") & ", scale " & show (ugc-scale 0))
      uefi-con-put-text 1 2 "AB" 15 1
      uefi-con-fill-row 3 7 4
      print-line-uni ("cells of AB: white " & show (count fb 16 16 32 32 #FFFFFF 16 0) & ", blue " & show (count fb 16 16 32 32 #0000AA 16 0) & " of 256")
      print-line-uni ("outside AB on rows 0 to 2: white " & show (count fb 32 0 640 48 #FFFFFF 0 0 + count fb 0 0 16 48 #FFFFFF 0 0) & ", blue " & show (count fb 32 0 640 48 #0000AA 0 0 + count fb 0 0 16 48 #0000AA 0 0))
      print-line-uni ("row 3 red " & show (count fb 0 48 640 64 #AA0000 48 0) & " of 10240, row 4 red " & show (count fb 0 64 640 80 #AA0000 64 0))
      let z = ugc-disable 0
      in print-line-uni ("disabled: " & (if ugc-on 0 then "still on" else "off"))
    end
  end
